  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka Serbiens Lantm&#xe4;teri, samt att bidra till att ett st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n V&#xe4;rldsbanken till RGA kunde genomf&#xf6;ras betr&#xe4;ffande registerring, dokumentation, information och tr&#xe4;ning av medarbetare inom RGA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the aim of the project was to strenghten the capacities of RGA. The Swedish supported project was part of Serbia`s cadastre programme financed by WB. The Swedish support mainly focused on capacity building in the field of registration, documentation, information and training that provided input into the work of RGA</narrative>
